<title>JAPAN: Nomura Securities down on scandal fallout.</title>
<headline>Nomura Securities down on scandal fallout.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd fell on Tuesday morning, still depressed by news that investment management firms were suspending business with the brokerage following news that two of its directors were involved in suspected illegal deals, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0026 GMT, the shares were down 30 yen at 1,440. It was the sixth most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo bourse, with trade totalling 1.898 million shares.</p>
</text>
